  - m_Id: 136808528593170434
    m_Localized: "<color=#4B4E6D>2</color>      Vitajte v Cargor!\n<color=#4B4E6D>3</color>     
      Z\xE1kladn\xFD pohyb\n<color=#4B4E6D>4</color>      Ako bali\u0165 produkty\n<color=#4B4E6D>5</color>     
      Ukladanie do reg\xE1lov\n<color=#4B4E6D>6</color>      Kami\xF3ny a doru\u010Dovanie\n<color=#4B4E6D>7</color>      
      Z\xE1kazn\xEDci\n<line-height=18><color=#4B4E6D>8</color>      \u0160peci\xE1lne
      po\u017Eiadavky: vr\xE1tenia,\ndvojit\xE9 objedn\xE1vky, zmie\u0161an\xE9 kami\xF3ny</line-height>\n<color=#4B4E6D>9</color>     
      N\xE1jom a va\u0161e peniaze\n<color=#4B4E6D>10</color>   Vylep\u0161enia\n<color=#4B4E6D>11</color>   
      N\xE1stenka \xFAloh\n<color=#4B4E6D>12</color>    Telef\xF3nna linka\n<color=#4B4E6D>13</color>   
      Oddychov\xE1 miestnos\u0165 a koniec d\u0148a\n<color=#4B4E6D>14</color>   
      Tipy na t\xEDmov\xFA pr\xE1cu"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
